Comment:
 s5066-mail ships as a self-contained single-file executable that bundles the .NET
 runtime and libraries (Copyright .NET Foundation and Contributors, MIT
 licence).
 .
 s5066-mail links only M0LTE.S5066.Cftp, M0LTE.S5066.Client and M0LTE.S5066.Core, not
 pdn-soundmodem, anything else under the GPL or any third-party mail library, so it is distributed under
 AGPL-3.0-or-later, and like those libraries it can also be licensed
 commercially from the copyright holder (see the repository README).

